  "content": "<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 750px; margin: auto; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #000;\"><div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"{{school_logo_url}}\" style=\"height: 60px;\"><h1 style=\"font-family: 'Garamond', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 36px; color: #b71c1c; margin: 5px 0;\">{{school_name}}</h1><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px;\">(RECOGNISED)</p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px;\">{{school_address}}</p><div style=\"border: 2px solid #000; display: inline-block; padding: 5px 20px; margin-top: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">TRANSFER CERTIFICATE</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><span>Certificate No: _________</span><span>Admission No: <strong>{{admission_no}}</strong></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 2.8;\"><p style=\"text-indent: 30px; margin: 0;\">This is to certify that Son/Daughter of <strong>{{father_name}}</strong>. His/Her date of birth as per school record is <strong>{{dob}}</strong>. He/She has been a student of this school and his/her moral character was <strong>Good</strong>. His/Her attendance for the academic session <strong>{{academic_session}}</strong> was good. All the school dues on his/her account have been paid in full upto date. He/She has been promoted/detained studying in class <strong>{{class_section}}</strong>.</p></div><table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 60px; font-size: 14px;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">Prepared by: _____________</td><td style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">Verified by: _____________</td><td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; vertical-align:bottom;\"><div style=\"width:150px; height:70px; border:1px solid #000; margin:auto; line-height:70px; color:#aaa; font-size:12px;\">Principal</div></td></tr><tr><td>Date of Issue: <strong>{{current_date}}</strong></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
